  "steps": [
    {
      "text": "• Finely chop brown onion and garlic.\n• Drain and rinse chickpeas.",
      "imageUrl": "https://img.hellofresh.com/f_auto,fl_lossy,q_auto,w_800/hellofresh_s3/recipe/step-65a469a31ee0609964aa0134-4fa663e4.jpeg"
    },
    {
      "text": "• In a large frying pan, heat a drizzle of olive oil over medium-high heat. Cook onion, stirring, until softened, 3-5 minutes.\n• Add garlic, chermoula spice blend, tomato paste and chickpeas. Cook, stirring, until fragrant, 1-2 minutes.\n• Add coconut milk and vegetable stock powder. Cook, stirring, until slightly thickened, 2-3 minutes.\n• Remove from heat. Stir in the butter until melted, then lightly mash chickpeas. Season with salt and pepper to taste. TIP: The butter helps balance out the acidity of the tomato paste!",
      "imageUrl": "https://img.hellofresh.com/f_auto,fl_lossy,q_auto,w_800/hellofresh_s3/recipe/step-65a469a31ee0609964aa0134-6f61b766.jpeg"
    },
    {
      "text": "• While the chickpeas are cooking, thinly slice cucumber into half-moons.\n• In a medium bowl, combine a drizzle of white wine vinegar and olive oil. Season, then add mixed salad leaves and cucumber. Toss to coat.\n• Microwave mini flourtortillas on a plate in 10 second bursts, until warmed through.",
      "imageUrl": "https://img.hellofresh.com/f_auto,fl_lossy,q_auto,w_800/hellofresh_s3/recipe/step-65a469a31ee0609964aa0134-165c81da.jpeg"
    },
    {
      "text": "• Fill tortillas with a helping of salad and chermoula-coconut chickpeas.\n• Top with a dollop of Greek-style yoghurt.\n• Tear over coriander leaves to serve. Enjoy!",
      "imageUrl": "https://img.hellofresh.com/f_auto,fl_lossy,q_auto,w_800/hellofresh_s3/recipe/step-65a469a31ee0609964aa0134-e53f6c3d.jpeg"
    }
  ]
}
